# Google Maps Platform API Key
# Leave blank here and copy this file to .env with your real key:
#   cp .env.example .env
#
# Option 1 (Fastest for Prototyping — No Billing Required):
#   1. Open https://mapsplatform.google.com/maps-demo-key?utm_campaign=gmp_git_agentsamples_v1.0.0
#   2. Sign in with any Google account and accept the Maps Demo Project Terms.
#   3. Click to generate/reveal your Maps Demo Key and paste it below.
#   Note: Demo keys have daily quota limits and are for prototyping only.
#
# Option 2 (Production Google Cloud Project Key):
#   1. Create or select a project in Google Cloud Console:
#      https://console.cloud.google.com/google/maps-apis/credentials?utm_campaign=gmp_git_agentsamples_v1.0.0
#   2. Enable: Maps JavaScript API, Places API (New), Routes API, Time Zone API, and Street View API.
#   3. Restrict your key by HTTP referrer (Web) / IP (Server) and API restrictions:
#      https://developers.google.com/maps/api-security-best-practices?utm_campaign=gmp_git_agentsamples_v1.0.0
GOOGLE_MAPS_API_KEY=your_google_maps_api_key_here
PORT=3000
